<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54323" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατακύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bend down, stoop</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσσω γὰρ κατέκυψε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.611
				</span></i>
			, cf. Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Jo.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>; <i>to be bowed down</i> by shame, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.8
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Strato</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>look down</i> from a window, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				9.32
			</span></i>; <i>stoop down and look</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸν βυθόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					2.16.22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. εἴσω τοῦ Χάσματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>DMort.</u>
					21.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. ἐς τὸ ἄστυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Icar.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
